ull/122615#issuecomment-5454442967","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122615","id":5454442967,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRRwx1w","user":{"login":"passivestar","id":60579014,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTc5MDE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60579014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar","html_url":"https://github.com/passivestar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-28T15:30:18Z","updated_at":"2026-08-28T15:30:18Z","body":"> Could I move the Tree to a FoldableContainer (that starts collapsed) so it can be expanded on demand?\r\n\r\nThat could work","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5454442967/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5496073951","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122615#issuecomment-5496073951","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122615","id":5496073951,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABR5du3w","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-01T15:09:42Z","updated_at":"2026-09-01T15:09:55Z","body":"> That could work\r\n\r\nI pushed an update with a FoldableContainer that starts out folded:\r\n\r\nFolded (default state) | Expanded\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"501\" height=\"668\" alt=\"Screenshot_20260901_170842\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c69d0d90-435f-45d6-9c9e-0c9715bbc424\" /> | <img width=\"501\" height=\"783\" alt=\"Screenshot_20260901_170848\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1338e0b6-00c5-4d6d-b6b6-1280e49b94a4\" />","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5496073951/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5973032273","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122615#issuecomment-5973032273","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122615","id":5973032273,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZAU9UQ","user":{"login":"jbsiraudin","id":22483902,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDgzOTAy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22483902?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jbsiraudin","html_url":"https://github.com/jbsiraudin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jbsiraudin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jbsiraudin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jbsiraudin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jbsiraudin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jbsiraudin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jbsiraudin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jbsiraudin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jbsiraudin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jbsiraudin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-03T20:10:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-03T20:10:07Z","body":"Tried a layout variation to improve readability and \"busy\" feeling. All hardcoded stuff to do it quickly, no code to share.\r\n\r\nBefore | After\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"502\" height=\"787\" alt=\"CreateBase\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/99d43f83-8525-49d6-af4c-eb14daecac7f\" />  | <img width=\"884\" height=\"782\" alt=\"CreatePresetNormal\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/63b309ad-d2ad-4174-a0c1-7bd3b073a473\" />\r\n\r\nA few explanations behind the edits:\r\n- Generic pass on texts (display fewer when possible, scale or dim depending on hierarchy of importance, etc)\r\n- **Presets as a grid of cards with a inspect panel**: took the idea from the unity and unreal project dialog. Goal is to streamline the choice into \"what am I making\", and then review and adjust. Each card could have an illustrative icon for each preset ([Defold template icons](https://defold.com/manuals/editor/) for reference), and their own documentation if relevant.\r\n- **Presets suggest a renderer**: this was discussed in the proposal already, but as something set in stone in the preset. Here you can still select the renderer you want before creating the project, it's just a preselection. This supposes creating a preset to renderer mapping (maybe a controversial topic?).\r\n- **Settings preview gets a 'Renderer' column**: Since some settings are only relevant when paired with specific renderer(s), changing the suggested renderer may _disable_ them. In that situation they are greyed out, and the column is added to understand why instantly.\r\n\r\n3D High-End Preset with Forward+ Renderer | 3D High-End Preset with Mobile Renderer\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"884\" height=\"782\" alt=\"CreatePresetNormal\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/63b309ad-d2ad-4174-a0c1-7bd3b073a473\" />  | <img width=\"884\" height=\"780\" alt=\"CreatePresetMobile\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6f139ad7-9232-479b-ae2c-3724988ad8a1\" />\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n**Known issues**\r\n- The toggle on/off state of the current buttons isn't great, the \"button grid to select\" may not the best solution nor the most consistent with the rest of the engine UX\r\n\r\nFeel free to take or leave any part of it.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5973032273/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6002453857","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122615#issuecomment-6002453857","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122615","id":6002453857,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZcYtYQ","user":{"login":"jbsiraudin","id":22483902,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDgzOTAy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22483902?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jbsiraudin","html_url":"https://github.com/jbsiraudin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jbsiraudin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jbsiraudin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jbsiraudin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jbsiraudin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jbsiraudin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jbsiraudin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jbsiraudin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jbsiraudin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jbsiraudin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-05T20:36:34Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T20:36:34Z","body":"Another thing that could answer all requests on \"can I define my own presets\" would be to \"apply settings from project ...\" : you pick another .godot file to copy the settings/renderer from.\r\nLooking at the code, I think it'd be pretty cheap. Maybe in a separate follow-up PR?\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6002453857/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6342369964","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122615#issuecomment-6342369964","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122615","id":6342369964,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABegjirA","user":{"login":"jbsiraudin","id":22483902,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDgzOTAy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22483902?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jbsiraudin","html_url":"https://github.co